      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "EBITDA was {{m:ebitda:FY0}} in {{p:FY0}} and {{m:ebitda:LTM}} in {{p:LTM}}.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "Kohl's operates in the highly competitive retail industry, with primary competitors including online retailers, off-price retailers, warehouse clubs, mass merchandisers, specialty stores, and traditional department stores.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "KSS-000119312526115982-0012",
          "quote": "The retail industry is highly competitive."
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "KSS-000119312526115982-0012",
          "quote": "Our primary competitors are online retailers, off-price retailers, warehouse clubs, mass merchandisers, specialty stores, traditional department stores, and other forms of retail commerce."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "The company's strategy emphasizes value, quality, and a frictionless customer experience across its omnichannel platforms.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "KSS-000119312526115982-0073",
          "quote": "reestablish Kohl’s as a leader in value and quality, and deliver a frictionless experience to customers across our omnichannel platforms."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "Many of the company's expenses, including store payroll and distribution costs, are variable in nature and generally move with sales.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "KSS-000119312526115982-0077",
          "quote": "Many of our expenses, including store payroll and distribution costs, are variable in nature. These costs generally increase as sales increase, and decrease as sales decrease."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "claims": [
    {
      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "Debt/EBITDA was stable from {{p:FY-2}} through {{p:LTM}}, at {{m:debt_to_ebitda:FY-2}}, {{m:debt_to_ebitda:FY-1}}, {{m:debt_to_ebitda:FY0}}, and {{m:debt_to_ebitda:LTM}}, respectively.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "Net leverage improved from {{m:net_leverage:FY-2}} in {{p:FY-2}} and {{m:net_leverage:FY-1}} in {{p:FY-1}} to {{m:net_leverage:FY0}} in {{p:FY0}} and {{m:net_leverage:LTM}} in {{p:LTM}}.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "EBITDA/interest coverage improved from {{m:interest_coverage:FY-2}} in {{p:FY-2}} and {{m:interest_coverage:FY-1}} in {{p:FY-1}} to {{m:interest_coverage:FY0}} in {{p:FY0}} and {{m:interest_coverage:LTM}} in {{p:LTM}}.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "FCF/debt improved from {{m:fcf_to_debt:FY-2}} in {{p:FY-2}} and {{m:fcf_to_debt:FY-1}} in {{p:FY-1}} to {{m:fcf_to_debt:FY0}} in {{p:FY0}} and {{m:fcf_to_debt:LTM}} in {{p:LTM}}.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "The improvement in free cash flow was driven by stronger operating cash flow from higher net income and lower inventory, and by lower capital expenditures.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "KSS-000119312526115982-0092",
          "quote": "The increase was primarily driven by more cash provided by operating activities due to a higher net income and inventory decreasing 7%"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "KSS-000119312526115982-0092",
          "quote": "capital expenditures decreased due to lower capital spend on the expansion of our E-commerce Fulfillment center in Etna, Ohio"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "Debt reduction also contributed to the improvement in net leverage, as the company made net repayments under its revolving credit facility.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "KSS-000119312526115982-0115",
          "quote": "Net (repayments) borrowings under revolving credit facility"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
