      "text": "The company maintains a $1.5 billion revolving credit facility, and as of {{p:FY0}} it had $44 million of standby and trade letters of credit outstanding under the facility, which reduced available borrowing capacity.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "KSS-000119312526115982-0135",
          "quote": "the $1.5 billion revolving credit facility"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "KSS-000119312526115982-0135",
          "quote": "we had $44 million of standby and trade letters of credit outstanding under the credit facility, which reduces the available borrowing capacity"
